    "items": [
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "One who isolates himself pursues selfish desires;",
          "he rebels against all sound wisdom."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A fool does not delight in understanding,",
          "but only wants to show off his opinions. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When a wicked person comes, contempt also comes,",
          "and along with dishonor, derision."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The words of a person’s mouth are deep waters,",
          "a flowing river, a fountain of wisdom."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "It is not good to show partiality to the guilty,",
          "denying an innocent person justice."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A fool’s lips lead to strife,",
          "and his mouth provokes a beating."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A fool’s mouth is his devastation,",
          "and his lips are a trap for his life."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A gossip’s words are like choice food",
          "that goes down to one’s innermost being. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The one who is lazy in his work",
          "is brother to a vandal. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The name of the Lord is a strong tower;",
          "the righteous run to it and are protected. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The wealth of the rich is his fortified city;",
          "in his imagination it is like a high wall."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Before his downfall a person’s heart is proud,",
          "but humility comes before honor."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The one who gives an answer before he listens —",
          "this is foolishness and disgrace for him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A person’s spirit can endure sickness,",
          "but who can survive a broken spirit?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The mind of the discerning acquires knowledge,",
          "and the ear of the wise seeks it."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A person’s gift opens doors for him",
          "and brings him before the great."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The first to state his case seems right",
          "until another comes and cross-examines him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Casting the lot ends quarrels",
          "and separates powerful opponents."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "An offended brother is harder to reach",
          "than a fortified city,",
          "and quarrels are like the bars of a fortress."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "From the fruit of a person’s mouth his stomach is satisfied;",
          "he is filled with the product of his lips."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Death and life are in the power of the tongue,",
          "and those who love it will eat its fruit."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A man who finds a wife finds a good thing",
          "and obtains favor from the Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The poor person pleads,",
          "but the rich one answers roughly."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "One with many friends may be harmed,",
          "but there is a friend who stays closer than a brother."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
